WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:03.208
[Chill music]

00:00:03.208 --> 00:00:04.416
- Ja!
- Hey, it’s Ja!

00:00:04.416 --> 00:00:06.125
- Best out of his draft class!

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:07.416
- Oh, and Dillon Brooks!

00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:10.875
- Man, I haven't seen Grit City this happy 
since we switched Gasols.

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:14.083
- Hopefully I can be a good face 
of the league for everyone.

00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:15.500
[Siren buzzing]
[Townspeople panicking]

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.041
- What’s going on?

00:00:19.916 --> 00:00:21.833
[Earth rumbling]

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:23.375
- Z...Zion!

00:00:23.375 --> 00:00:25.791
- ROARRRR!

00:00:25.791 --> 00:00:29.416
- [Dillon Brooks:] He’s got a new body.
[Evil laughing]

00:00:29.416 --> 00:00:32.375
♪♪♪  Born to be a hero ♪♪♪ 

00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:35.625
♪♪♪  Riaru-sa misetayo ♪♪♪ 

00:00:35.625 --> 00:00:38.625
♪♪♪  Born to be a legend ♪♪♪ 

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:41.791
♪♪♪  Hikari o mezashite ♪♪♪ 

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:46.500
♪♪♪  Born to be a hero ♪♪♪ 

00:00:48.666 --> 00:00:53.041
- ROAR!
- [Townsperson:] Oh, no! A titan with clothes on! Run!

00:00:53.041 --> 00:00:54.500
- ROARRR!

00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:58.708
-[Ja to himself:] Why is everyone so excited about Zion?

00:00:58.708 --> 00:01:01.000
He hasn't really done any-
- ROAR!

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.791
- Dillon, get the Gritizens to safety!

00:01:07.416 --> 00:01:10.125
[Ja to himself:] According to the overly detailed 
diagram in my head,

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:13.125
nothing can stop Zion once he gets 
through the perimeter.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.833
- Don't worry. There's strength in numbers.

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:28.708
[Zion evil laughing]

00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:31.666
- I still remember your weakness.

00:01:32.875 --> 00:01:34.041
[Zion groaning]

00:01:34.375 --> 00:01:35.083
[Gasps]

00:01:35.083 --> 00:01:36.875
Even his kicks have changed!

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.458
Time to get flashy.

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:43.791
[Zion groaning]

00:01:43.791 --> 00:01:46.000
The Association! It’s controlling him!

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.791
- ROARRRRR!

00:01:47.791 --> 00:01:50.333
- Zion! It’s not just you against me!

00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:51.708
This is bigger than that.

00:01:51.708 --> 00:01:53.375
Remember the code!

00:01:55.625 --> 00:01:58.750
- [Young Ja:] Zion, let’s promise to always be best friends.

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:02.083
- [Young Zion:] Promise! Now let’s go destroy 
some fellow children.

00:02:02.875 --> 00:02:04.791
[Shoes malfunctioning]

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.416
- The...code...

00:02:15.541 --> 00:02:18.250
Spoiler alert: I was in there the whole time.

00:02:19.458 --> 00:02:20.791
Whew.

00:02:20.791 --> 00:02:23.375
Thanks, bro. They really tried to pit us against each other.

00:02:23.375 --> 00:02:26.166
- Those old heads stay controlling the narrative.

00:02:26.166 --> 00:02:27.916
- We gotta fight back.

00:02:28.125 --> 00:02:29.291
Follow me.

00:02:35.208 --> 00:02:38.125
[Tense music]

00:02:40.666 --> 00:02:43.375
- Once Ja and Zion take each other out,

00:02:43.375 --> 00:02:45.750
nothing will be in our way.

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:47.291
- [Chuckling] Yeah, nothing.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:57.708
[Steady footsteps]

00:02:57.708 --> 00:03:01.875
- Are we sure we want to activate...him?

00:03:01.875 --> 00:03:04.875
- The Association headquarters are in The Holly Woods.

00:03:04.875 --> 00:03:06.708
So we attack them where it hurts.

00:03:06.708 --> 00:03:08.083
[Machine-like sounds]

00:03:10.666 --> 00:03:13.208
[Upbeat music]

00:03:13.208 --> 00:03:16.791
- [Charles Barkley:] The rising young stars are finally 
fighting the old heads.

00:03:16.791 --> 00:03:21.041
They're even taking down some legends from 
within their own ranks.

00:03:21.041 --> 00:03:26.291
There's no doubt a new class of heroes has risen up.

00:03:26.291 --> 00:03:30.583
And ain't no way LeBron and those bus riders 
taking out them kids.

00:03:30.583 --> 00:03:32.041
Take them out to dinner maybe.

00:03:32.041 --> 00:03:34.416
- Look at you. Already talking about food.

00:03:34.416 --> 00:03:36.125
- I know you not talking!

00:03:36.125 --> 00:03:37.875
All you talk about is barbecue chicken!

00:03:37.875 --> 00:03:39.291
- At least I got rings.

00:03:39.583 --> 00:03:40.333
- Ahhhhh!

